          "text": "Description: On November 4, 1977, a witness on a bus observed very quickly the movement of an oval object without any change in altitude. The object quickly disappeared, hidden by the urban landscape. No information was gathered from the Paris Observatory about this phenomenon, for which we have insufficient data.",
